        "testNames": [
          "connection-monitor",
          "subscribing checks the connection immediately, once",
          "repeated subscribe/unsubscribe — simulating a component re-rendering on every streamed token — never resets the backoff or re-probes",
          "escalates the interval across consecutive successes, matching getNextInterval",
          "notifies listeners false on failure and backs off",
          "a thrown checkConnection is treated as a failure, not an unhandled rejection",
          "setBusy(true) pauses probing: the scheduled tick rechecks without hitting the network",
          "stop() prevents any further probing",
          "a late subscriber gets the current snapshot immediately, without a new probe"
        ]
