        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The Codebuff terminal assistant no longer sends constant, unnecessary network pings to check if it is online. It now pauses its automatic connection checks whenever you are actively working with the AI, because the fact that your command is running proves the connection is alive. This is an internal stability fix that stops the app from flooding the service with duplicate requests; it will not change how you use the tool or what you see on screen.",
        "at": "2026-10-06T00:22:26.772Z",
        "src": "3cda29f05d59"
      }
